<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6a" title="In Causal-Entity Reflected Egocentric Traffic Accident Video Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Failure Case Analysis</span></a></li>
