<p id="S5.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="S5.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;">Tun.-Params: fine-tuned parameters (rate%).</em><span id="S5.I2.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text"></span></p>
